		(property "Description" "27nF C0G resonant capacitor C_RES in series with the coil U1 (EM4095 datasheet Fig. 8). With L(U1) ~49 uH and C4/C7 (0.9 nF) the antenna resonates at ~136 kHz; L is calculated, not measured: measure the coil on the bare PCB and re-tune with C6 = 1/((2*pi*134.2 kHz)^2 * L) - 0.9 nF"
